@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #E0F7FA
  BorderColor #0097A7
  FontColor black
}

actor 管理员 as Admin
actor 学习者 as Learner

rectangle "在线编程学习系统" {
  ' 管理员用例群
  (登录系统) as UC1
  (用户管理) as UC2
  (题目管理) as UC3
  (内容审核) as UC4
  (数据统计) as UC5
  (课程管理) as UC6

  ' 学习者用例群
  (注册账号) as UC7
  (用户登录) as UC8
  (题目练习) as UC9
  (代码提交) as UC10
  (讨论互动) as UC11
  (进度跟踪) as UC12

  ' 管理员关系
  Admin --> UC1
  Admin --> UC2
  Admin --> UC3
  Admin --> UC4
  Admin --> UC5
  Admin --> UC6

  ' 学习者关系
  Learner --> UC7
  Learner --> UC8
  Learner --> UC9
  Learner --> UC10
  Learner --> UC11
  Learner --> UC12

  ' 扩展关系
  UC8 .u.> UC7 : <<extends>>
  UC10 .d.> UC9 : <<includes>>
  UC11 .d.> UC8 : <<includes>>
}

note right of Admin
  **管理员核心功能：**
  1. 用户账户管理
  2. 编程题目维护
  3. 社区内容审核
  4. 学习数据分析
end note

note left of Learner
  **学习者核心功能：**
  1. 在线编程实践
  2. 即时代码评测
  3. 学习社区交互
  4. 个人成长追踪
end note

@enduml